WEBVTT

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:11.060
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:16.240
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.090
C'mon!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.380
Here I go!

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.590
Come on, don't tell me you're done already!

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:36.590
Shinsuke...

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.470
One more time!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.740
What's going on here, Shinsuke?

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.220
You're lacking force.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.660
Use stronger jumps!

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:01.760
Sangoku-senpai, am I good enough to keep being goalkeeper?

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.940
The opponents are only getting stronger...

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.290
But I'm not matching up to them the way I want to...

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.250
Even so, you're Raimon's guardian.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:15.700
I'll be graduating this year.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:19.000
When that happens, you're the only one who can protect Raimon's goal.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.960
It'll be up to you to protect soccer.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.080
But...

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.260
There's still time.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.760
It's okay to fail. Just give it all you've got!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.980
As long as I'm still in Raimon, I'll be right behind you!

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.840
Sangoku-senpai...

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:42.900
Tenma!

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.460
It sure feels great to kick the ball!

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.400
Taiyou!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.560
Long time no see!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.460
Are you back in good health?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.720
Yeah, completely!

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.540
That's great!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.500
Hiya! It's been awhile!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.280
Yeah.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.910
You two know each other?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.120
Is it the time paradox?

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.720
Fei, let me introduce you two.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:04:02.600
This is Arakumo Academy's ace striker, Amemiya Taiyou, who we fought with in Holy Road's semi-finals.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.700
It's nice to meet you.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.040
Taiyou, this is...

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.550
Fei Rune, right?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.240
I've heard the details from Gouenji-san.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.800
Gouenji-san?

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:13.180
Yes.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:19.320
He told me that Tenma is fighting to restore soccer, 
 and I wanted to help in any way I could.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.020
Tenma.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.070
Let's take soccer back together!

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.080
Taiyou...

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:25.920
Okay!

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:33.920
Taiyou!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:43.240
This is it, this is that feeling!

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.180
When everyone is chasing after a single ball!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.940
Not bad...

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:48.240
He's as good as Tenma says.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.700
Gouenji-san!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.520
Hey, you're back!

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.730
The Artifact this time is...

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.150
Kongming's scroll.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.120
Kongming's scroll...

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.520
Which means we're going to the Three Kingdoms period?!

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.250
That's right!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.220
Power #3!

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:13.040
A midfielder of unparalleled accuracy, who can see into the future and attack the enemy's weak spots with his analytical reasoning.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.280
That would be Zhuge Kongming!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.200
Power #4!

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:23.610
An iron-wall goalkeeper with the power to control a major country, along with the tenacity and will to carry out his actions.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.480
That would be Liu Bei, aka Liu Xuande!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.760
Liu Xuande!!!

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.260
I'm a huge fan of him!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.780
Who is that Liu Xuande guy?

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.260
Who?

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:39.300
Are you kidding me, Nishiki-kun? 
 You don't know about Three Kingdoms?!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.240
Nope.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.270
Neither do I.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.710
No way!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.750
I can't believe people who don't know Three Kingdoms actually exist!

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.340
The Three Kingdoms is...

00:05:51.640 --> 00:06:00.080
...the story of how the three states, Wei, Wu, and Shu, came about in China 1800 years ago.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.840
Liu Bei is one of the heroes.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:09.160
After he swore brotherhood with Guan Yu and Zhang Fei,

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:14.600
the three of them led armies to fight against the overwhelming strength of Cáo Cāo's troops.

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:21.740
That time, the person who supported Liu Bei as his strategist is the one we're searching for as power #3, Zhuge Kongming.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:26.920
I've never seen Hayami this enthusiastic before...

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.300
Me neither...

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.320
What sort of person was Liu Bei like?

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.700
Liu Bei was an honorable man with a very strong sense of duty.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.880
He was also very well liked.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:42.180
When Cáo Cāo's army was closing in on them, it's said that 100,000 people followed Liu Bei in his escape.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.880
But because having that many people would delay a quick escape,

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.590
some of Liu Bei's surbordinates advised him to leave those people and escape on his own.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:54.780
But Liu Bei said that he was unable to leave behind those who wished to follow him,

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.140
and he made sure to the very end that every last person came with him.

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:00.760
Pretty awesome, isn't he?

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:01.120
Yes!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.040
I can't wait! We'll get to see Liu Bei!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.300
Sounds like a rather complicated story.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:11.300
Now then, I'll announce the members for this time jump.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.860
The three managers and...

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.220
Matsukaze.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:17.140
Fei.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.000
Shindou.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:18.870
Tsurugi.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:19.870
Nishiki.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.870
Kirino.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.750
Kurama.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:22.620
Kariya.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:23.740
Nanobana.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:26.240
Amemiya and Nishizono.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:26.960
That is all.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.800
I'm staying behind?!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:37.140
Our goal is to take Liu Bei and Kongming's powers, not to go fanboying over idols.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.680
Do your best.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.840
I know you can do it.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:47.100
Go make that Mixi-max with Liu Bei work!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.380
Okay!

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.480
T minus 5 seconds to time jump!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:58.790
4...

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.160
3...

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.180
2...

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:01.880
1...

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.460
Time jump!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.460
They're on the move.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.480
I'll crush them for sure this time.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.480
Here we are, gang.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:21.180
So this is China 1800 years ago.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:24.730
Liu Bei is here somewhere...

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:29.500
Then let's commence looking for Liu Bei and Kongming immediately!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:30.960
Yeah!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.680
Or so we planned...

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.740
But at this rate, we won't even be able to find where a village is.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.440
There's someone here.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.400
Let's go check it out!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:45.960
Yeah!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:55.180
The day after tomorrow, the day after after tomorrow, the day after after after tomorrow, after after after~

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.460
That way!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.180
That guy's been singing "after after after" for a while now.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:03.120
After after after after after after after after after~

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:00.940
There!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.140
Um, excuse me!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.260
Look out!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.820
Just kidding!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.740
Did I scare you?

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.000
What's with this guy?

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.440
You've come at the right time.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.290
Could you help me out?

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.520
This thing got stuck and won't move at all.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.100
You and you, push over there.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.710
I'll push here with this guy.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.940
That's a rather large cannon.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.200
What are you going to use it for?

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:36.720
This?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.720
I'm going to catch me a turtle!

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.200
Turtle?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:44.880
Turtle?

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:49.020
Just kidding!

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:52.280
There's no way a turtle that big exists!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.190
Give me a break.

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.460
What I'm really going to catch is a dragon.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.700
Dragon?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.640
You're joking again, right?

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.160
No, I'm serious.

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:09.290
There's a giant net inside which I'm going to use to catch the dragon.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.800
Really?!

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.250
Well, everyone, let's get to it!

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.460
Push!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:26.520
Push! Push!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.140
Um...

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.740
Why not push it back for a moment?

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.380
The wheels in the back don't appear to be stuck.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.840
No, we'll keep pushing.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.780
If I've decided to push, then I push!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.280
So once he decides something, he doesn't turn back on his word.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.060
Come on, everyone, we'll get it this time!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:58.470
Push! Push!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.500
What a weirdo.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.140
All right!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.810
We did it, we did it!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:11.060
Guys, I don't think this man will know who Liu Bei is.

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:12.810
Honorable brother!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:15.620
Who are you?!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:19.190
We won't let you touch a hair on our honorable brother's head!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.080
Wait, wait, calm down.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.220
Right!

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.820
That is true! We shouldn't be hasty!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.100
We aren't anyone suspicious.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:32.620
We've come here to meet Liu Xuande and Zhuge Kongming.

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:34.670
Me?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.500
"Me"?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.020
Yeah.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:40.010
I'm Liu Xuande.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:45.010
This man is Liu Bei?!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.900
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:51.680
Go!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.800
Danball... Eleven?

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:54.860
Danball... Eleven?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.580
Inazuma... Senki?

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:58.940
Inazuma... Senki?

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:03.700
No, this is the movie, Inazuma Eleven GO VS Danball Senki W!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.660
"Things will work out"?

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.160
Not so fast!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.750
LBXs are mere tools for battle.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.460
Learn your place!

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:17.040
Elite soldiers gather together to fight against the sudden arrival of strong opponents!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.080
W-What is that?

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.580
Both soccer and LBXs must die!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.800
We won't let that happen!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:28.480
Soccer!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.090
LBXs!

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.890
The greatest crisis falls upon both of them now!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.380
Are you telling me you can only control one LBX at a time?

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.260
Never-before-seen LBXs...

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.110
We need them too...

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.900
New LBXs!

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.820
And never-before-seen hissatsu techniques!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.240
Great Blaster!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.160
Mixi-trans!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.910
I'll crush you all!

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.040
Stop!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.440
Let's go!

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:57.500
Avatar...

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.500
Armed!

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.920
Big Bang Slash!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.840
Glorious Ray!

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:06.180
Is that all you've got?

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.930
With faith in our friends, we'll take on everything you have!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.400
Make it in! Passing spacetime and dimension and created out of friendship--

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:12.600
God Hand... W!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.770
God Hand... W!

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:20.020
Inazuma Eleven GO VS Danball Senki W, the movie!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:24.140
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:28.400
You're Liu Xuande?

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:31.160
Yeah. And these are my sworn brothers...

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.020
Guan Yu...

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:33.880
And Zhang Fei.

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:38.180
They're way different than how I imagined them from Gouenji-san's explanation...

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:38.880
Yeah...

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.420
This man is Liu Bei...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.840
In that case, let's get straight to it!

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.390
That... That was close...

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.110
You've fallen silent.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:03.170
If you're searching for our honorable brother and Kongming, you must be working for that wretched Cáo Cāo!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:09.180
No, if they were Cáo Cāo's men, they would have attacked me by now.

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.190
Right! I was trying to say they would have attacked you, too!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:14.980
Liu Bei.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.360
Please listen to what we have to say!

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.200
Who would listen to the likes of you?!

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.060
Why not?

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.640
Besides, I'm in their debt for helping me drag this thing out of the mud.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.620
Right!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.220
I was getting ready to listen to them, too!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.580
Are those two always like that?

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:31.010
Probably...

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:34.350
We aren't from this time period.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:39.080
We have come here from the future so that we may borrow Liu Bei and Kongming's powers.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.080
The future?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.510
Yes.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:48.820
We have a big crisis in our time period, and to fix it we need Liu Bei and Kongming's powers.

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:50.030
Please!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.780
Help us!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.700
You think we'd believe a silly tale like that?!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.580
I'll cut you down!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.500
That's a good joke!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.120
Best joke I've ever heard!

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:07.700
Right!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.920
I wanted to say it was the best, too!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.600
Then let's go meet Kongming right away!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.960
Although, to be honest, this will be my first time meeting Kongming too.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:20.810
You've never met before?

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.520
Kongming is a pretty difficult character.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.860
I've already gone to meet Kongming twice without success.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.780
The first time...

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.700
Kongming!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.440
I came up with a really funny joke!

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.120
Would you like to hear it?

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.580
The bed bedded down for the better! {布団がふっ飛んでﾌﾄﾝと落ちてきた！}

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.130
The second time...

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.920
Kongming!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.920
I came up with an even funnier joke!

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.470
Would you like to hear it?

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:57.930
The kappa's nightcap was all capped out! {ｶｯﾊﾟが かっぱらった！}

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.940
The plate on its plated plate was so parched that it plated! {ｶｯﾊﾟのお皿が乾いて ｶｯﾊﾟｶﾊﾟ！}

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.440
But I won't give up.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.380
I need Kongming's help to unite the country.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:19.120
If I've decided Kongming must help me, then Kongming must help me!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.100
That's so cool!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.340
Now, let's get going!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:25.460
Right, honorable brother!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:27.800
You're taking that with you?

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:30.260
Aren't you capturing a dragon with it?

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.040
Kongming can apparently transform into a dragon.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:38.880
If Kongming changes into a dragon and tries to fly away, I'll fire this and drag the dragon back.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:45.190
When men gain life in this world~

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.780
Now's my chance!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.190
Mixi-max!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.530
It didn't work...

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:58.080
Maybe I'm still not strong enough...

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:07.000
So... they're planning to take Liu Bei and Kongming's powers...

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.880
This is Zhuge Kongming's estate...

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:16.100
First we need to figure out how to get this door open.

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:19.140
We can't meet Kongming if we can't get through the door.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.580
Open up!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.900
It's locked, my honorable brother.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.650
I'll thrash it down!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:34.020
No, if we break the door, Kongming will get upset and be even more reluctant to join us.

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:35.140
Right!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:37.780
I didn't think Kongming would join us that way either!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.160
Besides, there should be respect even among close friends.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:43.370
How can you be close when you haven't even met before?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.520
My honorable brother, I just had a thought...

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.120
Kongming is a well renowned strategist.

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.880
Would Kongming really choose to come in and out through this unhidden door?

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.140
Perhaps the door isn't-

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.320
What's that?

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.760
I think it could be a hole to put our hands through.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.100
A hole for our hands?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:02.280
Could it be...

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.060
My brother!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.540
It opened!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.400
The door opens upwards!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.060
Good work!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:15.800
I'm Shinsuke!

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.440
Oh, Shinsuke, eh?

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.560
That's a good name!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.990
Yes! Thank you!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.200
Guan Yu, what was it you were saying?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.860
No, never mind!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.220
Then let's go in!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.050
My capture device!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.010
W-What was that?

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:47.800
This estate is littered with traps, and once you're inside, you can't get back out again easily.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.780
It's otherwise known as Kongming's Fortress.

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.900
I've heard that some people have lost their lives in here.

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:55.200
Their lives?!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.980
You tell us this now?!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:58.780
We'll just have to keep going.

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:06.830
Mind Control Mode.

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:16.240
Nothing here seems particularly suspicious.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:16.800
Yeah...

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.300
Look out!

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.920
Just kidding!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.180
You fell for it!

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.240
You geezer!

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:28.580
Don't joke at a time like this!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.300
Let's keep moving.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.940
We won't let you take a step further!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:40.440
Honestly! Guan Yu and Zhang Fei, you shouldn't joke around either!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.060
No, they're not joking.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.400
They look as if they're controlled by some form of black magic.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:52.080
Who are you?

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.290
Protocol Omega?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.920
Don't group us with those losers.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:19:59.590
A soccer battle!

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:04.560
Are you the ones who cast black magic on my brothers?!

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:06.420
Just you wait, Guan Yu! Zhang Fei!

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.460
I'll save you now!

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:10.080
No, Liu Bei!

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:13.900
In order to save those two, we need to win against them in a soccer battle.

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:15.560
Soccer battle?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:25.280
It's a fight where whoever takes the ball from the opponent and lands it in the opponent's box first wins.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.740
Leave this to us.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.400
Liu Bei, you should stay here and watch.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.000
I can't do that!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.280
I've decided to rescue Guan Yu and Zhang Fei with these very hands!

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:37.040
Now that I've decided, I will save them no matter what!

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:40.680
In that case, will you act as our goalkeeper?

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:41.510
Goalkeeper?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.140
Your role is to protect this box.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:48.680
Stop any ball that comes flying at you to keep it from going inside the box.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.350
All right, leave it to me.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.740
I wish I could play too.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:00.470
No rushing into it.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:04.740
First, we want you to see who it is that we're fighting against.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.280
Okay.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.540
Will Liu Bei-san be okay?

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.880
He'll be fine.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.670
If Liu Bei were to be killed...

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:23.280
As long as it's by the hands of someone in the same era, history will change, but it won't cause any distortions in spacetime.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:27.010
But we are forbidden from erasing historical figures.

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.380
I thought you'd say that.

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:32.400
Rules don't apply to me.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:36.140
Got it? Whoever makes the first point in wins.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.400
Let's go!

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.110
Get ready.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:43.150
Tenma!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:46.610
He got past Tenma?!

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:49.230
You won't be able to beat us with moves like that!

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:52.810
You won't get past me!

00:21:55.820 --> 00:21:57.500
I'll end this with one blow!

00:21:59.020 --> 00:21:59.540
Liu Bei!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:02.130
What?!

00:22:02.560 --> 00:22:03.800
Good one, Tsurugi-kun!

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:04.760
Tenma!

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:06.620
All right, it got through!

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:13.930
No good. At this rate, they'll never be able to steal back the ball.

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:17.440
This is the enemy that Tenma and the others are fighting...

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.400
I see...

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:22.940
They protect the ball with their feet to prevent it from being taken.

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:26.280
Zhang Fei!

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.360
I won't let you do as you please!

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:31.160
Captain!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.200
Good, he got it!

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:35.830
Bring it in!

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:37.040
Okay!

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:45.190
Give it to me, Tenma!

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:48.130
Liu Bei?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:50.840
Then that means...

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:52.550
No way.

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:56.860
The goal is wide open!

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:26.880
In order to meet Zhuge Kongming, we go through a big trial.

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:30.150
A soccer battle with a mysterious terracotta puppet army!

00:24:30.150 --> 00:24:32.940
Next, Surprise! Kongming's Fortress!!

00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:35.200
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:24:45.240 --> 00:24:49.440
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:56.100
It's okay to fail. Just give it all you've got!

00:24:56.100 --> 00:24:57.240
That's all!
